| File | Lines | What |
|---|---|---|
| src/interpreter.rs | +94 −0 | Read-only accessors for imported modules, module members, and declared object fields/methods |
| src/repl/commands.rs | +44 −0 | `env`/`environment`, `types`, `dir <expression>`, `typehints` command table entries |
| src/repl/mod.rs | +581 −1 | Live session listings and `.dir` answer, plus the environment-map tests |

